         // we reserve M-4 and M-2 for the sparse encapsulation switching keys
         // Even autorphism indices are not possible, so there will not be any conflict
-        (*evalKeys)[M - 4] = KeySwitchGenSparse(privateKey, skNew);
+        //
+        // COMPOSITESCALING: KeySwitchGenSparse/KeySwitchSparse are a single-tower (q0, p)
+        // fast path — the composite bottom level has compositeDegree towers, whose integer
+        // representative lives mod q0*...*q_{d-1}, so the per-tower SwitchModulus extension
